# pbots (11-22): the one-time run that makes a bot's pirate. skip-tutorial #t = the kids' path: "new pirate" on the
# avatar list opens the standalone pirate maker (s_kidmaker.py drives it: random look, picked name, Done) and the
# new pirate goes straight into the world, no opening tutorial. Plain textures: the maker is a one-off, no strip.
skip-tutorial #t
want-water-reflection 0
want-avatar-shadows 0
